<SECTION SCID = "T010041A266S"><SCTITLE/>

<PARA INFOID = "T010041A266" UPDATE = "ORIGINAL" LDUP = "10Oct2005"     INFOTYPE = "PARTS" INDSW = "ON">
<TITLE>Reservoir Tank</TITLE>
<LIST1><ITEM><PTXT>A fully sealed type with both gas-liquid separation performance and cooling system pressure stabilization performance has been adopted.</PTXT></ITEM>
<ITEM><PTXT>The radiator reservoir tank cap performs the role of a conventional radiator cap, regulating the radiator internal pressure.</PTXT></ITEM></LIST1>
